\]

Calculate the angular speed:
\[
f = \frac{10000\ \text{rpm}}{60} \approx 166.7\ \text{rev/s}
\]
\[
\omega = 2\pi f \approx 2\pi (166.7) \approx 1.047 \times 10^{3}\ \text{rad/s}
\]

